# Performance Requirements

## Speed Targets
- **Activation:** < 100ms from hotkey to picker ready
- **Total Workflow:** < 2 seconds from activation to HEX in clipboard
- **Memory:** < 50MB RAM usage
- **CPU:** < 1% idle, < 5% when active

## Optimization Rules
- Profile before optimizing
- Avoid premature optimization
- Use efficient algorithms for color conversion
- Minimize UI redraws

## Success Metrics
- Activation: < 100ms ✅
- Total workflow: < 2 seconds ✅
- Memory: < 50MB ✅
- CPU: < 1% idle, < 5% active ✅
- HEX accuracy: 100% ✅
- Hotkey reliability: 99.9%+ ✅
- Crash rate: < 0.1% ✅
